This repository is a derivative work with two layers of lineage:

1. It ports Anthropic, PBC and Learning Commons's `k12-teacher-skills` v0.6.0
   (Apache-2.0) — https://github.com/anthropics/k12-teacher-skills — to the
   Korean 2022 revised national curriculum.
2. It is itself a fork of `raphysicst-create/science-teacher-skills`
   v0.3.0-preview.1 (Apache-2.0) — the science-only Korean port — replaced
   end-to-end for the 사회(social studies) subject.

See NOTICE headers in individual files and DESIGN.md ADR-7 for what changed
at each layer.
